CELL 59 — ODD-SECTOR & EXCITED-EVEN SPECTRAL-GAP AUDIT & COMMUTATOR RESOLVENT
========================================================================================
Parameters: c = 13, L = 2.56494935746154, T = 400, dps = 50

Auditing exact rank-2 and rank-4 commutator resolvent algebra:
  [Q, K]   = -psi d^T + d psi^T
  [Q, K^2] = -(K psi) d^T - psi k^T + k psi^T + d (K psi)^T
  (Q - lambda_0 I) K c   = -D_0 psi
  (Q - lambda_0 I) K^2 c = -D_0 (K psi + M_1 d)

